      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第9题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-09",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26北京）将2个不等大的正方体粘接为一个多面体，表面积比原来2个正方体表面积之和最多可能减少1/15，则原来较大正方体的棱长是较小正方体的多少倍？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "2"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "3"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "4"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          162
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          156
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-09-p162.webp",
            "alt": "几何问题（二） · 实战精刷9 · 讲义第156页",
            "pdfPage": 162
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-09-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s15-t03-drill-09",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设大、小正方体的棱长为a、b。表面积减少最多时，整个小正方体的一面贴在大正方体面上，消失的面积为2b²。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "原表面积合计6a²+6b²，减少比例1/15，因此2b²÷（6a²+6b²）=1/15，解得a²=4b²。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\frac{2b^2}{6a^2+6b^2}=\\frac1{15}\\Rightarrow a^2=4b^2\\Rightarrow\\frac ab=2"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "棱长均为正，所以a=2b，我们选B。面积比开平方后才是棱长比。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
